# Public targets for HT_Pert/code/lri_d1_full_coefficient_flow: the S10 engine (complete Dconn window coefficients
# C0..C8 of the d = 1 frozen-cutoff HT, exact half-order Rayleigh quotient), shipped verbatim at the production commit
# fec60a2 (the supplied archive plus the symmetry extension), with the production records L = 46..72 in
# ../../data/HT_1d/s10_production. public/ is added. HT_Pert note: d = 1 window section and reproduction table.
# Run from this folder:  make -f public.mk test | replay | smoke | fetch-data | clean
#
#   test        public/verify_manifest_public.py (MANIFEST.sha256, 85 files, SCRUBBED.txt honoured; seconds), then
#               public/run_tests_s10.py (tests/run_all.py on a copy in $(WORK)/tree, rewritten results compared with
#               the shipped ones order-insensitively at 1e-12; about 2 min, one core), then public/fresh_s10.py
#               --set small (fresh Dconn run at L = 2..24, degree 8, checked by code/compare_archive.py at rtol 1e-10;
#               seconds). About 2 min on one Xeon Gold 6148 core, < 1 GB.
#   replay      public/replay_s10.py: rows s10.* (results_map.md): record and code binding, \HTpWinLamEight, the dC
#               table regenerated byte for byte, dC6..dC8 at L = 72, \HTpSTenMatch. Seconds. Reads
#               ../../data/HT_1d/c8/extrapolation/data.json and
#               ../lri_hpc_Hamitonian/analysis/eps5_window/reconcile/dC_reconciled.json (SKIP rows when absent).
#   smoke       public/fresh_s10.py --set validate: the production gate's validation (Dconn L = 40, 42, 44 and raw
#               L = 44 against the archive, rtol 1e-10), as in symmetry job 571525. 10-13 min, one core, 2.4 GiB.
#   fetch-data  nothing is hosted for this package.
# The production rerun (L = 46..72: 14 exclusive 180 GB nodes, 38.5 node-hours) is documented in REPRODUCE and
# SYMMETRY_EXTENSION.md (slurm/submit.sh); it is not a make target.
PY    ?= python3
WORK  ?= .work
DATA  ?= ../../data/HT_1d
HAM   ?= ../lri_hpc_Hamitonian
export PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE = 1
export OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS = 1
export MKL_NUM_THREADS = 1
export OMP_NUM_THREADS = 1
export MPLBACKEND = Agg
export NUMBA_CACHE_DIR ?= $(WORK)/numba_cache

.PHONY: test replay smoke fetch-data clean
test:
	$(PY) public/verify_manifest_public.py
	$(PY) public/run_tests_s10.py --work $(WORK)
	$(PY) public/fresh_s10.py --set small --work $(WORK)

replay:
	$(PY) public/replay_s10.py --data $(DATA) --ham $(HAM) --work $(WORK)

smoke:
	$(PY) public/fresh_s10.py --set validate --work $(WORK)

fetch-data:
	@echo "lri_d1_full_coefficient_flow: nothing is hosted; the archive records (results/) and the production"
	@echo "records ($(DATA)/s10_production) are in git."

clean:
	rm -rf $(WORK)
